#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Authenticated single-direction control RPC daemon for Custom Debian 13 KVM guests.

Protocol (SSOT):
  - Transport: newline-delimited JSON ('\n'), request-response.
  - Max single line: 2 MiB; max decoded content per file: 1 MiB.
  - Request:  {"id":"<req_id>","token":"<64-hex>","op":"<op>","params":{...}}
  - Response: {"id":"<req_id>","ok":true,"result":{...}}
           or {"id":"<req_id>","ok":false,"error":"<code>","message":"<msg>"}
  - Supported ops:
      sync_file, publish, publish_universal, block, clear, status, core_check, restart_crag
  - Zero external dependencies (Python 3 stdlib only), zero reverse-pull.
"""

